    Bug 1982562 - Clear connection/certificate alert debounce flag after 5 seconds. r=freaktechnik

    This will ensure the flag always gets cleared, whether the OS calls `alertfinished` or not.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D260810

